        "# Task 11: Object-Oriented Programming - Creating a Class\n",
        "# Create a class called 'Rectangle' with attributes 'length' and 'width'.\n",
        "# Include methods to calculate area and perimeter.\n",
        "\n",
        "# Your code here:\n",
